  "body": "This allows selective delivery of classic scripts only to older user\r\nagents. Fixes #1442.\r\n\r\n/cc @whatwg/modules\r\n\r\nThis is meant to give something concrete to discuss. As @jakearchibald pointed out, it's important that if we do this, everyone does it, so let's try to get some sign-off from all vendors.\r\n\r\n- [x] Chrome, @nyaxt says this is good to go\r\n- [x] Edge, @travisleithead says Edge supports this\r\n- [x] WebKit, @rniwa and @Constellation support downthread\r\n- [x] Gecko: support from various Mozillans in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1330900, including implementers",
